import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'stack':('The ten rapiers that weighed as one',
  'A stack of ten rapiers in the pack, weighed by the home-value maths. The Borg multiplied the weapon weight by the stack size, so ten 4-pound rapiers were treated as one 40-pound sword: the Borg computed 1 blow where the engine gives 2 per weapon. The correction weighs one weapon, like the engine: 2 equals 2.'),
 'single':('Control: a single rapier',
  'A lone rapier has a stack size of one, so the multiplied and single weights agree: 2 blows in both variants, and the complete log is byte-identical.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/homeblows-313 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag in ('RATING ','OUTCOME '):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[tag.split()[0].lower()]=match[1].strip() if match else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>The ten rapiers that weighed as one</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native blows calculations</p><h1>The ten rapiers that weighed as one</h1><p>Totalling up the home, the Borg asked how many blows a stack of weapons gives - and weighed the whole stack as if it were one weapon, so a stack of light blades under-counted its own blows and biased every home comparison.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the control establishes</h2><p>A single rapier (stack size one) agrees in both variants: 2 blows, byte-identical logs. The correction only removes the stack multiplier.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Warrior (strength 17, dexterity 16) on an arena at depth 30, seed one thousand, with a stack of ten identified rapiers in the pack; the item is parsed through the production borg item analyzer, the blows are computed by the production borg formula and the engine formula side by side. The measured fact is the divergence itself; what it does to a home decision is the report\'s mechanism, not claimed here. No death or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/313">issue313</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);let r=d.rating||'';let m=r.match(/borg_blows=(\\d+) engine_blows=(\\d+)/);p.querySelector('.num').textContent=m?('Borg '+m[1]+' vs engine '+m[2]):'n/a';p.querySelector('.state').textContent=d.outcome||'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='stack'?'The original weighs the whole stack: 1 blow where the engine gives 2; the correction weighs one weapon: 2 equals 2.':'A single rapier was never affected: 2 equals 2, byte for byte.';}select.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
